---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Free driveway quote — Precision Surfacing, Norfolk"
description: "Norfolk's driveway specialists. Resin, block paving, tarmac, tar & chip and gravel, laid by our own team. Book your free site visit and written quote."
permalink: "/free-quote-b/"
hideChrome: true
bodyClass: "lp"
extraCss: free-quote.css
extraJs: free-quote.js
robots: "noindex, follow"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{# Facebook ad landing page, version B: split hero that mirrors the ad creative #}
{% include "partials/lp-top.njk" %}

  <section class="lp-hero lp-hero-b">
    <div class="lp-wrap lp-hero-split">
      <div class="lp-hero-copy">
        <span class="lp-eyebrow">Setting the standard</span>
        <h1 class="lp-h1">Norfolk's<br>driveway<br><em>specialists.</em></h1>
        <p class="lp-hero-lede">Top-quality work at competitive prices. Every driveway laid by our own team, with a free site visit and written quote.</p>
        <div class="lp-ctas">
          <a class="lp-btn lp-btn-gold lp-btn-lg" href="#quote">Get a free quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          <a class="lp-btn lp-btn-ghost lp-btn-lg" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" data-call>Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-stack">
        {% for s in [
          ["Resin bound", "resin/projects/wells-silver-grey/wells-silver-grey-resin-driveway-finished.webp"],
          ["Block paving", "block-paving/projects/st-faiths/st-faiths-block-paving-driveway-finished.webp"],
          ["Tarmac", "tarmac/projects/sheringham-grey/sheringham-grey-tarmac-driveway-finished.webp"],
          ["Tar & chip", "tar-and-chip/projects/the-old-hall/the-old-hall-tar-and-chip-driveway-finished.webp"]
        ] %}
        <a class="lp-stack-item" href="#quote" data-pick="{{ s[0] }}"><img src="/assets/images/{{ s[1] }}" alt="{{ s[0] }} driveway" {% if loop.first %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %} decoding="async"><span>{{ s[0] }}</span></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/lp-body.njk" %}
